+<a id="reserved-admission-and-request-preparation"></a>
+## Reserved admission and request preparation
+
+The serial scoped `agent/prepare-prompt` event awaits owner refresh before each request attempt is assembled. Errors prevent provider dispatch. Deferred creation/resume returns owner-held release and close capabilities; explicit durable reservations reject ordinary resume. Factories must declare `supportsDeferredExecution` before deferred construction is admitted. The final scoped `agent/model-admission` check follows route preparation before model input commit or dispatch.
+
+Execution owners use `agents.guardExecution(agent, guard)` to register synchronous scoped authorization for model or activation admission. Guards run at final synchronous execution cutoffs, after asynchronous listeners and route preparation. The effect disposer removes only its exact registration.
+
